经验法则：提到主动性驱动，意味着需要大时间框架参与者最终推动价格。
Rule of thumb: Whenever we speak about initiative, it means we require large-timeframe participants to ultimately drive the price.

690
02:13:09,670 --> 02:13:10,810
好，他们发起过程
